  "description": "Unlock flawless foil pressing, clean laser engraving, and effortless sketching with Lutheria! Designed as a true single-line handwritten script font, it features smooth continuous monoline paths with elegant looped capitals and sweeping leg details. Optimized specifically for CNC machinery, foil quills, and digital plotters, it guarantees crisp, single-pass lines without double-outline overlaps.\nIdeal for Cricut foil transfers, Silhouette sketch pens, laser-engraved wood and acrylic gifts, wedding invitation cards, CNC routing projects, custom jewelry engraving, and delicate line art branding!",
